","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":164832160,"digest":"sha256:97dde58e22a463727f1a61a3044a584930c0655553d9e12cf25dac350226e798","download_count":53,"created_at":"2026-10-27T00:45:06Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T00:45:11Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/releases/download/v1.39.6/envoy-contrib-1.39.6-linux-x86_64"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/envoyproxy/envoy/tarball/v1.39.6","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/envoyproxy/envoy/zipball/v1.39.6","body":"**Summary of changes**:\r\n\r\n* Upstream security fixes:\r\n  - [eMudhra intermediate CA compromise](https://emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com/):\r\n    release: updated the `distroless` docker image base to pick up the patched\r\n    `ca-certificates` package (`20250419+deb13u1`), so it no longer trusts the roots of the\r\n    compromised eMudhra intermediate CAs. The distroless image released in 1.39.5 still\r\n    shipped the unpatched bundle.\r\n\r\n**Docker images**:\r\n    https://hub.docker.com/r/envoyproxy/envoy/tags?page=1&name=v1.39.6\r\n**Docs**:\r\n    https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/v1.39.6/\r\n**Release notes**:\r\n    https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/v1.39.6/version_history/v1.39/v1.39.6\r\n**Full changelog**:\r\n    https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/compare/v1.39.5...v1.39.6\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Jonh Wendell <jwendell@redhat.com>\r\nSigned-off-by: Ryan Northey <ryan@synca.io>\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/envoyproxy/envoy/releases/424884637","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/envoyproxy/envoy/releases/424884637/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/envoyproxy/envoy/releases/424884637/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/releases/tag/v1.38.9","id":424884637,"author":{"login":"publish-envoy[bot]","id":140627008,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCGHMQA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.